  "id": "map",
  "term": "MAP",
  "definition": "MAP, or System Support Mapping, is a guided method in which trained facilitators help people make a visual diagram of their self-management activities within the context of their everyday lives. The map is used to make these activities easier to see and understand, supporting self-awareness and more active participation in managing them.",
